<Plugin>
  <Name>UGREEN DXP4800 Pro LEDs</Name>
  <Overview>Control the Power, LAN and four drive-bay LEDs of the UGREEN DXP4800 Pro running Unraid. Configure colours, brightness, disk activity pulses and standby breathing in Settings → LED Settings. Preview colours and brightness on the front-panel image, including connectivity and SMART warning colours. Requires Unraid 7.3.2+ and a matching bundled module for kernel 6.18.38-Unraid, 6.18.54-Unraid or 6.18.58-Unraid.</Overview>
